# Timed run: a short press of B starts the whole dash; walking on without B keeps running until the
# dash ends, then the cooldown. Up and down so Jian stays on map 1 (r_live from watch_reentry.plan).
load r_live
press B,Up 4
hold Up
wait 30
release
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y_up1
peek u32 0x020B6CF0 st_up1
shot tap_up1
hold Down
wait 30
release
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y_dn1
peek u32 0x020B6CF0 st_dn1
shot tap_dn1
